[36m(TaskRunner pid=210759)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=210759)[0m Using the property of exponents \((a^m)^n = a^{mn}\), we can simplify the right side of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=210759)[0m 
